                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ccbc83c-5142-4b83-b4dd-cfc729a6d991",
                                                "sense_id": "aca336ef-9333-399a-bdd0-6688c6a9ddc5",
                                                "text": "Thirty years later, in his book How the Self Controls Its Brain (Springer Verlag, 1994), [John] Eccles posited that the “mind” produces “psychons” (i.e., fundamental units of consciousness, a term previously mostly used in cheesy science fiction) […]"
